# W44-165 (Smart-Zenjxl chunk 2) HONEST-STOP — restore W44-117 EPF seed admission for photos on Zenjxl

## Status

[HONEST-STOP — production gate-site REVERTED]

## What the chunk attempted

Per W44-163 Smart-Zenjxl audit B5 pick. Re-enable the W44-150 Mechanism A
photo admission to the W44-117 EPF sharpness seed on
`EncoderStrategy::Zenjxl` / `Aggressive`. The W44-150 honest-stop
(`cec823de`) had reverted the gate because the +0.27 mean SSIM2 delta on
1418519 d=5/6 missed the 50% closure HARD gate. Per the user directive
2026-05-21 ("restore any superior options according to the current
encode strategy selection"), Smart-Zenjxl chunk 2 was tasked with shipping
the partial recovery on the Zenjxl strategy.

## What measured

