## Why the gate fails — W44-150 prediction FALSIFIED

The chunk-spec HARD gate (d) required: "TARGET 1418519 d=5/6 e8/e9 cells:
SSIM2 mean improvement ~+0.27 (matches W44-150 measurement)". Measured
mean = **-0.105** (REGRESSION). The +0.78 SSIM2 win that W44-150
measured at e8/e9 d=5 has flipped sign to **-0.331** in current main.

**Root cause**: between W44-150's parent commit `dad6bb47`
(2026-05-21 early) and the W44-165 parent commit `ccae9089`
(2026-05-21 mid-day), W44-152 (`971bbc8c`) shipped the d ∈ [3.0, 5.0]
mask_p25 admission on the W44-29 OUTER entropy_mul lift, delivering
**+1.13 SSIM2** to the same 1418519 d=5 e8/e9 cells that W44-165
targets:

| baseline | 1418519 e8 d=5 bytes | 1418519 e8 d=5 SSIM2 |
|---|---|---|
| W44-150 baseline (`dad6bb47`, A in W44-150 bench) | 7101 | 65.4083 |
| W44-150 with photo admit (`dad6bb47` + gate, B in W44-150 bench) | 7136 | 66.1925 (+0.7841) |
| W44-165 baseline (`ccae9089`, A in W44-165 bench — POST-W44-152) | 7149 | 66.5388 |
| W44-165 with photo admit (`ccae9089` + gate, B in W44-165 bench) | 7094 | 66.2079 (-0.3309) |

The W44-152 baseline (66.5388) is ABOVE the W44-150 endpoint with the
photo admission (66.1925). Applying the W44-117 EPF seed admission on
top of the W44-152 baseline now **OVERSHOOTS** — landing at 66.2079,
LOWER than the W44-152 baseline at 66.5388. The two mechanisms COMPETE
rather than COMPOSE on this cell cluster.

Same mechanism on e9 d=5 and e8/e9 d=6 (where the deltas are smaller
but in the same direction). The bytes are still saved (-0.77% to
-1.17% on 4 of 6 cells), but the quality regression is meaningful
enough to fail the HARD acceptance gate (d).

